OL,3,AUS embassy child abuse images suspect
OL,4,Aflown from UK before police interview
OL,5,
OL,6,FA US embassy staffer accused of
OL,7,Fpossessing indecent images of children,
OL,8,Fwas detained at his south London flat
OL,9,Fand flown out of the UK in August,
OL,10,Fwithout being first questioned by
OL,11,FBritish police.
OL,13,FThe US Embassy confirmed to the BBC
OL,14,Fthat authorities are investigating the
OL,15,Fallegations and they have reassigned
OL,16,Fthe staff member to the US while
OL,17,Finquiries continue.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
