OL,3,AUS embassy child abuse images suspect
OL,4,Aflown from UK before police interview
OL,5,
OL,6,F"The United States government expects
OL,7,Fall personnel to adhere to the highest
OL,8,Fstandards of conduct, and we take these
OL,9,Fallegations seriously," embassy
OL,10,Fofficials said in a statement.
OL,12,FThey added that they "quickly informed
OL,13,FUK law enforcement and took swift
OL,14,Faction."
